# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout can't produce phantom
# whole-file diffs.
#
# core.autocrlf=true converts to CRLF on checkout. ruff's format config
# pins line-ending=lf, so any file git had rewritten to CRLF showed up as
# "would reformat" with a diff containing no visible changes — and a
# stash round-trip on _version.py produced exactly that during the
# 2026-Q3 recalibration. Declaring the intent here makes the repo's
# behaviour independent of each clone's local git config.

# Text files: LF in the repository and in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
